    <title>Reason for Visit</title>
    <text><paragraph>Establishing primary care for recurrent disabling headaches, seven days into a bout: headache history and red-flag screen, a headache diary, disability and mood screening, acute treatment, avoiding medication overuse, and an old right wrist injury that slows his writing [S]</paragraph></text>

